    {
     "text": "",
     "dur": 0.8,
     "cam": "wide",
     "sfx": "wind"
    },
    {
     "who": "rati",
     "text": "What have the gods done? They called my husband here, and he burned for them! Kama, you were dearer to me than my own life!",
     "text_hi": "देवताओं ने यह क्या किया? उन्होंने मेरे पति को यहाँ बुलाया, और वे उनके लिए जल गए! कामदेव, आप मुझे अपने प्राणों से भी प्रिय थे!",
     "cam": "mid:rati"
    },
    {
     "who": "indra",
     "text": "Rati, keep his ashes safe. Shiva never causes sorrow without reason. He will bring your husband back.",
     "text_hi": "रति, उनकी भस्म सँभालकर रखो। शिव बिना कारण दुख नहीं देते। वे तुम्हारे पति को लौटाएँगे।",
     "cam": "mid:indra"
    },
    {
     "who": "shiva",
     "text": "What my anger has done cannot be undone. Kama will live without a body, Ananga. And when Krishna is born on earth, Kama will be born again, as his son.",
     "text_hi": "मेरे क्रोध ने जो किया, वह लौट नहीं सकता। कामदेव बिना शरीर के जीवित रहेंगे, अनंग बनकर। और जब धरती पर कृष्ण जन्म लेंगे, कामदेव उनके पुत्र बनकर फिर जन्मेंगे।",
     "cam": "wide"
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "And so love lives on in the world, everywhere, and invisible.",
     "text_hi": "और इस तरह प्रेम संसार में जीवित है, हर जगह, और अदृश्य।",
     "camMove": true,
     "cam": "mid:rati",
     "capPos": "bottom"
    }
